      "message": "Without the sleep, no other threads run.\nhttps://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/boards/posix/doc/arch_soc.html#posix-arch-limitations\n\nIn this case other threads probably don\u0027t need to run since this test directly calls both `board_override_fan_control_duty()` and `fan_tick()`.  But it\u0027s better practice to avoid busy wait loops.",
